            "text": "The cleanest, fastest repository for training/finetuning medium-sized GPTs. Still under active development, currently trying to reproduce GPT-2 on OpenWebText dataset. The code itself is tiny, plain and readable. At the moment `train.py` is a ~200-line boilerplate training loop and `model.py` a ~300-line GPT model definition, which can also load the GPT-2 weights from OpenAI."
